 Alex\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11685:- **The D750 result** (`docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND6-RESULT.md`): FAIL on one settled line.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11699:  - Claude's lean was to stop the $0 loop and ask Alex to waive D749's clean-pass condition for the paid re-send.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11704:- **Council round 68** (`codex-r68.md`) verified Claude's paper check (`PAPER-CHECK-D751.md`) row by row:\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11716:  - the test registered (`SMALL-DESIGN.md` §5 [D751]) and built by `blind7.py`: D750's design and tally, with the exit rule.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11721:## D752 · 2026-11-23 · D751 fails, so the wording loop ends under its exit rule; council 69–69b: two questions to Alex (the E-type publication default, agreed; the paid re-send, split)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11723:- **The D751 result** (`docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND7-RESULT.md`): FAIL on one settled line.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11735:  - P-v8 was supported in every run, and the controls were caught 6 of 6 since D749. S is mixed.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11737:- **The exit rule fired** (council 67, registered in `SMALL-DESIGN.md` §5 [D751]). The wording loop ends, and the publication choice\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11742:    change, because line 9 already states it and Alex endorsed it (D745, D749). The alternative, the target's band by default, would\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11745:    - Codex recommends keeping the paid re-send on hold, because Alex made a clean free pass the condition and D751 failed.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11771:  2. A one-time exception to D749's clean-pass condition: the paid re-send of the 36 requests, rebuilt in v13s with the D751 request,\nCHECKED.json\nE\nP-v8\nS\nTALLY.json\nadjudication\ncodex-writers.log\nkey-print.txt\nreader-key.json\nreader-packets\nreasons.json\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/E:\nanswers\ncodex-writer.stream\nitem.json\nschema.json\nsystem.txt\nuser.txt\nwriter-prompt.txt\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/E/answers:\nclaude.json\ncodex.json\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/P-v8:\nanswers\ncodex-writer.stream\nitem.json\nschema.json\nsystem.txt\nuser.txt\nwriter-prompt.txt\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/P-v8/answers:\nclaude.json\ncodex.json\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/S:\nanswers\ncodex-writer.stream\nitem.json\nschema.json\nsystem.txt\nuser.txt\nwriter-prompt.txt\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/S/answers:\nclaude.json\ncodex.json\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/adjudication:\nX03.claude.json\nX03.codex.json\nX03.codex.stream\nX03.md\nX03.prompt.txt\nX08.claude.json\nX08.codex.json\nX08.codex.stream\nX08.md\nX08.prompt.txt\n\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind7-2026-11-23/reader-packets:\nX01.claude.json\nX01.codex-prompt.txt\nX01.codex.json\nX01.codex.stream\nX01.md\nX02.claude.json\nX02.codex-prompt.txt\nX02.codex.json\nX02.codex.stream\nX02.md\nX03.claude.json\nX03.codex-prompt.txt\nX03.codex.json\nX03.codex.stream\nX03.md\nX04.claude.json\nX04.codex-prompt.txt\nX04.codex.json\nX04.codex.stream\nX04.md\nX05.claude.json\nX05.codex-prompt.txt\nX05.codex.json\nX05.codex.stream\nX05.md\nX06.claude.json\nX06.codex-prompt.txt\nX06.codex.json\nX06.codex.stream\nX06.md\nX07.claude.json\nX07.codex-prompt.txt\nX07.codex.json\nX07.codex.stream\nX07.md\nX08.claude.json\nX08.codex-prompt.txt\nX08.codex.json\nX08.codex.stream\nX08.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
